prop wall_duct wall pipes 2.0 1.0 0.3 5.0 1.8 0.5 1.1 0.0 0
prop machine_block structural machinery 2.0 2.0 2.0 4.0 3.5 4.0 1.8 1.0 1
prop support_column structural machinery 0.8 3.0 0.8 1.2 5.0 1.2 1.3 0.8 1
